	(23, 1, '2026-08-14 14:20:52', '2026-08-14 14:20:52', '<section>\n										<h5  data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="1.3s"></h5>\n										<h1 data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="1.5s">\n											Targeted Audience,\nProven Results.										</h1>\n										<p data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="1.7s">\n																					</p>\n											<a href="http://localhost/samplits/about-us/" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="1.7s">\n												Explore Programs												\n											</a>\n											<a href="" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="1.7s">\n											</a>\n	</section>\n					<img data-interaction-id="051dff0" id="56" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/samplits_logo.png" width="800" height="290" srcset="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/samplits_logo.png 800w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/samplits_logo-300x109.png 300w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/samplits_logo-768x278.png 768w" alt=""/>					<h1 data-interaction-id="47e86ae">is</h1>\n		<p> a digital sampling platform that connects brands with targeted consumers through strategic product distribution and data-driven insights. We help brands drive awareness, encourage product trial, and capture high-quality first-party data. Each campaign delivers real-time consumer feedback to improve targeting, refine marketing strategy, and support smarter brand growth.</p>			<img data-interaction-id="8421d9e" id="140" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/home-1.webp" width="1024" height="775" srcset="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/home-1.webp 1024w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/home-1-300x227.webp 300w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/home-1-768x581.webp 768w" alt=""/>					<h2 data-interaction-id="f1863ef">Why Samplits?</h2>\n					<h2 data-interaction-id="cec5aed">01</h2>\n					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TARGETED REACH</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<h2 data-interaction-id="963fdec">02<br></h2>\n					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TARGETED REACH</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<h2 data-interaction-id="63cd57e">03<br></h2>\n					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TARGETED REACH</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<h2 data-interaction-id="1c80657">04</h2>\n					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TARGETED REACH</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<h2 data-interaction-id="69fd85c">Our Core Values</h2>\n					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TRUSTED NETWORK</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TRUSTED NETWORK</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TRUSTED NETWORK</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<figure><img width="53" height="73" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icon-gift-bag.webp" alt="" /></figure><h3>TRUSTED NETWORK</h3><p>We connect brands with the right audience through relevant digital sampling experiences.</p>					<h2 data-interaction-id="b21c9f4">Our Programs</h2>\n					<img data-interaction-id="3bcd0ff" id="44" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo.png" width="800" height="323" srcset="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo.png 800w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-300x121.png 300w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-768x310.png 768w" alt=""/>					<figure><img width="1024" height="1024" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11.webp" alt="" /></figure><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>					<h5 data-interaction-id="0d8f8dd"><a href="/" target="_self">\n		Learn More...\n	</a></h5>\n					<img data-interaction-id="ce95896" id="247" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-family-connect.png" width="512" height="89" srcset="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-family-connect.png 512w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-family-connect-300x52.png 300w" alt=""/>					<figure><img width="1024" height="1024" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/program2.webp" alt="" /></figure><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>					<h5 data-interaction-id="82d803e"><a href="/" target="_self">\n		Learn More...\n	</a></h5>\n					<img data-interaction-id="ebb5f42" id="248" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-lead-boost.png" width="512" height="92" srcset="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-lead-boost.png 512w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-lead-boost-300x54.png 300w" alt=""/>					<figure><img width="1024" height="1024" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/program3.webp" alt="" /></figure><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>					<h5 data-interaction-id="1b1233e"><a href="/" target="_self">\n		Learn More...\n	</a></h5>\n					<img data-interaction-id="461ca5a" id="258" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-social-click.png" width="512" height="130" srcset="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-social-click.png 512w, http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-social-click-300x76.png 300w" alt=""/>					<figure><img width="1024" height="1024" src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/program4.webp" alt="" /></figure><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>					<h5 data-interaction-id="5121e09"><a href="/" target="_self">\n		Learn More...\n	</a></h5>\n			<h2 data-wow-delay=".3s">\n							</h2>\n		<a href="" data-wow-delay=".5s">\n			Let\'s connect			\n		</a>\n					<h2>Let\'s grow<br>\nyour brand<br>\ntogether.</h2>		<p>Tell us about your goals and our team will be in touch to explore how Samplits can help you drive trial, engagement and measurable results</p>			<h2 data-interaction-id="158b0d5">Contact Form</h2>\n		<form id="wpforms-form-288" data-formid="288" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/samplits/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php" data-token="b9111e92a9c21f1ec312a070de99d49e" data-token-time="1789057208"><noscript>Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.</noscript>Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.<label for="wpforms-288-field_1">Company Name</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-288-field_1" name="wpforms[fields][1]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_1-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_2">Contact Name</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-288-field_2" name="wpforms[fields][2]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_2-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_3">Work Email *</label><input type="email" id="wpforms-288-field_3" name="wpforms[fields][3]" spellcheck="false" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_3-error" required><label for="wpforms-288-field_4">Phone Number</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-288-field_4" data-rule-inputmask-incomplete="1" data-inputmask-mask="+1 (999)-999-9999" name="wpforms[fields][4]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_4-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_5">Subject</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-288-field_5" name="wpforms[fields][5]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_5-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_6">Tell us about your goals</label><textarea id="wpforms-288-field_6" name="wpforms[fields][6]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_6-error" ></textarea><!-- .wpforms-field-container --><input type="hidden" name="wpforms[id]" value="288">			<input\n				type="hidden"\n				name="wpforms[nonce]"\n				value="f3275437f1"\n			/>\n			<input type="hidden" name="page_title" value="{page_title}"><input type="hidden" name="page_url" value="http://page_url"><input type="hidden" name="url_referer" value="http://url_referer"><button type="submit" name="wpforms[submit]" id="wpforms-submit-288" data-alt-text="Sending..." data-submit-text="Send Message" aria-live="assertive" value="wpforms-submit">Send Message</button><img src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/plugins/wpforms-lite/assets/images/submit-spin.svg" style="display: none;" width="26" height="26" alt="Loading"></form>  <!-- .wpforms-container -->			<h6 data-interaction-id="3cee21b">We respect your privacy. Your information is safe with us.</h6>\n					<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>				\n			<h5 id="heading22d90ef-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse22d90ef-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse22d90ef-st-2">\n					How can my clinic or hospital become a distributor of Baby Brands Gift Bags?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					Simply fill out our<a href="https://babybrands.ca/app/front/distributor-registration" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: underline;color: inherit"> distributor form</a>   to get started.\n			<h5 id="heading90d4327-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse90d4327-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse90d4327-st-2">\n					What types of healthcare providers are eligible to distribute Baby Brands Gift Club Bags?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					We partner with a variety of trusted healthcare professionals and services that care for new and expecting families, including Hospitals, Clinics, OB/GYN and Doctor offices, Doulas and Midwives, Prenatal/postnatal centers, Baby shows and community programs\n			<h5 id="heading8a21f1e-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse8a21f1e-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse8a21f1e-st-2">\n					Are there any costs involved with becoming a distributor?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					There is no cost to participate in the program. However, we will review the shipping costs to your location. If needed, we’ll contact you to discuss and confirm an agreement before accepting your distributor application.\n			<h5 id="heading2c93300-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse2c93300-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse2c93300-st-2">\n					How many gift bags will my center receive?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					The number of bags you receive will depend on the volume of new and expecting parents your location sees on a monthly basis. We aim to supply you with the right amount based on your needs.\n			<h5 id="heading640e9d5-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse640e9d5-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse640e9d5-st-2">\n					Can I request additional bags if I run out?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					Yes! If you need more gift bags due to higher-than-expected demand, just email us at info@babybrands.ca and we’ll do our best to fulfill your request quickly.', 'Home', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'home', '', '', '2026-09-10 16:20:08', '2026-09-10 16:20:08', '', 0, 'http://localhost/samplits/?page_id=23', 0, 'page', '', 0),
	(24, 1, '2026-08-14 14:18:39', '2026-08-14 14:18:39', '', 'Elementor #23', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '23-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-14 14:18:39', '2026-08-14 14:18:39', '', 23, 'http://localhost/samplits/?p=24', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
	(25, 1, '2026-08-14 14:22:48', '2026-08-14 14:22:48', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class="wp-block-quote">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class="wp-block-quote">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href="http://localhost/samplits/wp-admin/">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Sample Page', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-14 14:22:48', '2026-08-14 14:22:48', '', 2, 'http://localhost/samplits/?p=25', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
