" name="wpforms[fields][2]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_2-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_3">Work Email *</label><input type="email" id="wpforms-288-field_3" name="wpforms[fields][3]" spellcheck="false" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_3-error" required><label for="wpforms-288-field_4">Phone Number</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-288-field_4" data-rule-inputmask-incomplete="1" data-inputmask-mask="+1 (999)-999-9999" name="wpforms[fields][4]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_4-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_5">Subject</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-288-field_5" name="wpforms[fields][5]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_5-error" ><label for="wpforms-288-field_6">Tell us about your goals</label><textarea id="wpforms-288-field_6" name="wpforms[fields][6]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-288-field_6-error" ></textarea><!-- .wpforms-field-container --><input type="hidden" name="wpforms[id]" value="288">			<input\n				type="hidden"\n				name="wpforms[nonce]"\n				value="c92dc42986"\n			/>\n			<input type="hidden" name="page_title" value="{page_title}"><input type="hidden" name="page_url" value="http://page_url"><input type="hidden" name="url_referer" value="http://url_referer"><button type="submit" name="wpforms[submit]" id="wpforms-submit-288" data-alt-text="Sending..." data-submit-text="Send Message" aria-live="assertive" value="wpforms-submit">Send Message</button><img src="http://localhost/samplits/wp-content/plugins/wpforms-lite/assets/images/submit-spin.svg" style="display: none;" width="26" height="26" alt="Loading"></form>  <!-- .wpforms-container -->			<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>				\n			<h5 id="heading22d90ef-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse22d90ef-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse22d90ef-st-2">\n					How can my clinic or hospital become a distributor of Baby Brands Gift Bags?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					Simply fill out our<a href="https://babybrands.ca/app/front/distributor-registration" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: underline;color: inherit"> distributor form</a>   to get started.\n			<h5 id="heading90d4327-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse90d4327-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse90d4327-st-2">\n					What types of healthcare providers are eligible to distribute Baby Brands Gift Club Bags?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					We partner with a variety of trusted healthcare professionals and services that care for new and expecting families, including Hospitals, Clinics, OB/GYN and Doctor offices, Doulas and Midwives, Prenatal/postnatal centers, Baby shows and community programs\n			<h5 id="heading8a21f1e-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse8a21f1e-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse8a21f1e-st-2">\n					Are there any costs involved with becoming a distributor?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					There is no cost to participate in the program. However, we will review the shipping costs to your location. If needed, we’ll contact you to discuss and confirm an agreement before accepting your distributor application.\n			<h5 id="heading2c93300-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse2c93300-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse2c93300-st-2">\n					How many gift bags will my center receive?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					The number of bags you receive will depend on the volume of new and expecting parents your location sees on a monthly basis. We aim to supply you with the right amount based on your needs.\n			<h5 id="heading640e9d5-st-2">\n				<button type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n					data-bs-target="#collapse640e9d5-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse640e9d5-st-2">\n					Can I request additional bags if I run out?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					Yes! If you need more gift bags due to higher-than-expected demand, just email us at info@babybrands.ca and we’ll do our best to fulfill your request quickly.', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '23-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-19 09:22:36', '2026-08-19 09:22:36', '', 23, 'http://localhost/samplits/?p=322', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
