ta-bs-target="#collapse640e9d5-st-2" aria-expanded="true"\n					aria-controls="collapse640e9d5-st-2">\n					Can I request additional bags if I run out?\n				</button>\n			</h5>\n					Yes! If you need more gift bags due to higher-than-expected demand, just email us at info@babybrands.ca and we’ll do our best to fulfill your request quickly.', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '23-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-09-10 16:18:57', '2026-09-10 16:18:57', '', 23, 'http://localhost/samplits/?p=378', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
